OL,3,GNEWSABuses boost pledge for York's
OL,4,A'garden village'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers behind plans for a new
OL,7,F"garden village" near York, where
OL,8,Fconcerns have been raised about
OL,9,Fincreased traffic congestion, have said
OL,10,Fthe scheme would bring a "significant"
OL,11,Fboost to local buses.
OL,13,FCaddick Group, part of the team behind
OL,14,Fthe Langwith project at Elvington
OL,15,FAirfield, has said it hopes to apply
OL,16,Ffor outline planning permission early
OL,17,Fnext year.
OL,19,FSpeaking at a public consultation
OL,20,Fevent, local resident Richard Fawcett
OL,21,Fsaid: "Infrastructure is the real issue
OL,22,Fhere, transport being the main one."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
